                "recommended": "<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows XP SP3, Vista SP2, 7\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 or AMD Phenom II X2 555\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2GB\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Graphics:</strong> ATI Radeon HD 3870 or NVIDIA GeForce 9800 or faster\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>DirectX&reg;:</strong> 9.0c\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 4GB free\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Sound:</strong> DirectX 9.0c-compatible\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Other:</strong> 256 Kbps+ recommended for multiplayer. 3-4 player co-op require internet connection\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>"
